# PC card team-gunline (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 10.4, TMODE-19): arm mgl (TMODE-19 gun lines, ablation tmgunline: GUNLINE_K 0.4, GUNLINE_HALF 70), all 46 teams against master (the aa build). Template: gnprep writes work/team-gunline-mgl.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
6
--seed-base
4500
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
team-census46.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@mgl.jar
--robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@mgl
--member
hadur2.Hadur
--out
work/team-gunline-@V@-mgl
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-gunline-mgl.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@aa
